   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(32,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]木連#cと地球の対立の元になっているのは、\nたぶん火星の遺跡です。 \nこれが全ての元凶なんです！",
   "en": "<op(32,1)><sp(2)>The root of conflict between the #c[BE5050]Jovians#c\nand Earth is likely the ruins on Mars.\nThat is the source of all of this!",
   "notes": "Yurika identifying root cause."
