    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(32,1)><sp(2)>そういうわけで、<im(6)>#c[5E8FD8]ナデシコ#cは今、\n遺跡に向かっています。\n現在、そのための作戦を実行中です。",
   "en": "<op(32,1)><sp(2)>And so, the <im(6)>#c[5E8FD8]Nadesico#c is now heading\nfor the ruins, carrying out\nan operation to that end.",
   "notes": "Yurika briefing operational movement."
