 "report": {
  "translator_summary": "Yurika concludes explaining their narrow escape after being framed for Tsukumo Shiratori's murder, with Ruri bluntly summarizing they walked into a trap; Noin briefs Phase 2 to intercept Jovian fleet vessels heading to the Mars ruins. In combat, the Jovian Majin pilot Genichirou Tsukiomi attacks, furiously branding Earth an evil empire and accusing Tsukumo of being an Earth spy to justify his shooting. Akito and Gai clash with him over his twisted Gekiganger-like concept of justice before Tsukiomi retreats. In Phase 3 tactical briefing, Yurika resolves to end the war their own way by targeting the Mars ruins with Nergal's help, despite knowing the risks, and Captain Sinapus orders the Albion to support the Nadesico with all hands to battle stations.",
  "rows_examined": "op19_01 (m6191#55-66), op19_02 (m6191#67-82, brief63119#2-5, m6192#3-53, brief63120#2-13, m6193#0-2), op19_03 (m6193#3-14)",
